      "type": "text",
      "x": 32,
      "y": 96,
      "width": 1400,
      "height": 63,
      "text": "One PostgreSQL database per school · physical isolation · school_id is metadata, never a control\nEntities are drawn only where the corpus names them. Every PC-xxx gap is drawn as a gap, not filled with a plausible table.\nSources: SRS §6 · MP §5 · MP §17.6–17.10 · ARC-01 · ADR-003 · ADR-002 · AGENTS.md §2.1–§2.9",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#5b6270",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "id": "el_000003"
    },
