      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 48,
      "y": 3154,
      "width": 608,
      "height": 21,
      "text": "One database per school",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#4f46e5",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "id": "el_00004v"
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 4,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 31676,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 48,
      "y": 3178,
      "width": 608,
      "height": 17,
      "text": "one PostgreSQL database and one deployment per school (ADR-003). Isolation is physical, so school_id is metadata — there is no `School` table, no tenant scoping and no cross-tenant role. Uniqueness is scoped inside the one database, never global.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#161a23",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "id": "el_00004w"
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": null,
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
      "seed": 4,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 31676,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "rectangle",
      "id": "el_00004x",
      "x": 704,
      "y": 3142,
      "width": 640,
      "height": 124,
      "strokeColor": "#4f46e5",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff"
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 4,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 31676,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 720,
      "y": 3154,
      "width": 608,
      "height": 21,
      "text": "Money is integer minor units",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#4f46e5",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "id": "el_00004y"
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 4,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 31676,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "x": 720,
      "y": 3178,
      "width": 608,
      "height": 17,
      "text": "every amount carries an explicit currency code and integer minor units (ADR-002). Scale and rounding mode are per-school settings, never constants. Nothing in this system uses a real-number money type.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#161a23",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "id": "el_00004z"
    },
    {
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
